    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7935" root="حس" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْسُوسٌ</span></b>  pass. part. n. of 1, q. v. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [As a subst.
it means <i>A thing perceived by any of the senses;
an object of sense:</i> pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْسُوسَاتٌ</span>.] ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الطَّرِيقُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَحْسُوسَةُ</span> [lit., <i>The way that is sensibly perceived;</i> app., <i>the milky way in the sky:</i> or] <i>the
tract in the sky along which</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْهَا</span>) <i>the</i> [<i>wandering</i>]
<i>stars</i> [or <i>planets</i>] <i>take their courses.</i> (TA voce
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَجَرَّةُ</span>.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ مَحْسُوسَةٌ</span> (assumed tropical:)  <i>Land smitten by locusts.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاسُوسٌ</span>.

